1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,380
5 conspiracy theories that
sounded crazy,

2
00:00:02,510 --> 00:00:03,490
and turned out to be real.

3
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:08,300
1. In 1968, a Soviet submarine
sank in the Pacific.

4
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:11,670
The CIA secretly built a giant ship
to lift it from the seabed.

5
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:12,600
The cover story?

6
00:00:12,970 --> 00:00:15,760
A billionaire, Howard Hughes,
was mining the ocean floor.

7
00:00:16,450 --> 00:00:21,170
2. In 1971, activists broke into an
FBI office and stole its files.

8
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:23,400
They proved the FBI was secretly
spying on civil rights leaders

9
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:25,440
and antiwar groups.

10
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:30,380
3. For decades, tobacco companies said
smoking was not proven harmful.

11
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:33,900
In 2006, a federal judge ruled
they had lied to the public.

12
00:00:34,390 --> 00:00:38,000
4. In 2013, the US intelligence chief
told Congress the NSA did not

13
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,280
collect data on millions of Americans.

14
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:44,660
Then Edward Snowden leaked proof that
it collected phone records.

15
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:46,830
Courts later ruled the program unlawful.

16
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:52,660
5. In the 1950s, the CIA ran mind-control
experiments, including drug tests.

17
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:55,520
In 1973, it ordered the files destroyed.

18
00:00:55,820 --> 00:00:57,120
Congress found out anyway.

19
00:00:57,790 --> 00:00:58,980
Which one shocked you?

